  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gender Secretariat - Gender Secretariat Phase 2</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">J&#xe4;mst&#xe4;llldhetssekretariat</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;det avser st&#xe4;rka kapacietten hos Socialinisteriets                 J&#xe4;mst&#xe4;lldhetsdirektorat, samt ge st&#xf6;d f&#xf6;r genomf&#xf6;randet av den        J&#xe4;mst&#xe4;lldhetsstrategi samt handlingsplan som regeringen fastst&#xe4;llt.   Komponent 5 kommer att st&#xf6;dja de f&#xf6;rsta 12 m&#xe5;naderna av genomf&#xf6;randet av den handlingsplan inom tre omr&#xe5;den.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will support preparatory activities for the               implementation of the Serbian Gender Equality Action Plan, by         strengthening the capacity of mandatory GE actors in Serbia. Gender   Equality Directorate is the project partner, IMG the implementing     partner. Component 5 will support the first 12 months of the          implementation of the Gender Equality Action Plan in three areas.</narrative>
  </description>
